<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#350d0e"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=heritage-chat-1"></head>
<body class="heritage-app subpage chat-page"><%- include('partials/navbar') %>
<main class="chat-shell"><section class="chat-panel" aria-label="Tourism chat"><div class="chat-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker" data-i18n="chat.kicker">GWALIOR, WITH CONTEXT</span><h1>Tansen <em>AI</em></h1><p data-i18n="chat.description">Ask about places in our dataset or plan a visit around your day.</p></div><button id="newChat" class="chat-new" type="button" data-i18n="chat.new">＋ New conversation</button></div><div class="chat-prompts" aria-label="Suggested questions" data-i18n-aria-label="chat.suggested"><button type="button" data-i18n="chat.promptHeritage">What heritage places are in the dataset?</button><button type="button" data-i18n="chat.promptFees">What are the entry fees?</button><button type="button" data-i18n="chat.promptPlan" data-chat-intent="plan">Plan a four-hour Gwalior visit</button></div>
<details class="trip-details"><summary>Trip details for planning requests</summary><div class="trip-fields"><label>Starting address or place<input id="startLabel" maxlength="200" placeholder="Enter starting point"></label><label>Start latitude<input id="startLat" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="26.2298"></label><label>Start longitude<input id="startLng" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="78.1733"></label><button id="useLocation" type="button">Use my current location</button><label>Visit date<input id="visitDate" type="date"></label><label>Start time<input id="startTime" type="time" value="09:00"></label><label>Return deadline<input id="deadline" type="time" value="17:00"></label><label>Available minutes<input id="availableMinutes" type="number" min="1" max="1440" value="240"></label><label>Interests<input id="interests" maxlength="300" placeholder="heritage, music, food"></label><label class="return-option"><input id="returnToStart" type="checkbox" checked> Return to my starting point</label><label id="endLocationField" hidden>Destination name<input id="endLabel" maxlength="200" placeholder="Final destination"></label><label id="endLatField" hidden>Destination latitude<input id="endLat" inputmode="decimal"></label><label id="endLngField" hidden>Destination longitude<input id="endLng" inputmode="decimal"></label><p class="trip-note">Location is requested only when you press the button. Typed place names need coordinates; address search is not configured.</p></div></details>
<div id="chatMessages" class="chat-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite"><div class="chat-bubble assistant" data-i18n="chat.welcome">Namaste! I can answer from Beyond the Fort’s attraction records, or use the tourism planner for routes and schedules. Fees and hours may be unavailable in the records.</div></div><div id="chatStatus" class="chat-status" aria-live="polite"></div><form id="chatForm" class="chat-input"><label class="sr-only" for="messageInput">Your message</label><textarea id="messageInput" maxlength="2000" rows="1" placeholder="Ask about Gwalior or plan your visit…" data-i18n-placeholder="chat.placeholder" required></textarea><button type="submit" aria-label="Send message" data-i18n-aria-label="chat.send"><span data-i18n="chat.send">Send</span>&nbsp; ↗</button></form></section></main><script src="/js/i18n.js?v=nav-i18n-1"></script><script src="/js/main.js?v=heritage-6"></script><script src="/js/chat.js?v=heritage-chat-1"></script></body></html>
